player_prompt.intro:
O oe o le Tagata Taʻalo {player_id} i se Taʻaloga a 3 Tagata Taʻalo o le Prisoner's Dilemma Faʻaauau. O le taʻaloga umia {num_rounds} ripoti.
Faʻagasologa o le Ripoti:
• {conv_rounds} faʻamalosi taʻaloga chat
• 1 faʻaiʻuga turn - tuʻuina atu se token mo tagata teteʻe: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' poʻo '[<opp-id> defect]' (e manaʻomia '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; o le faʻaiʻuga e 'cooperate'). 
Faʻavae o le faʻamaumauga (faʻaaogaina i tagata teteʻe uma):
  - Olu i faʻatasi  ->  {reward}
  - Olu i faʻaleagaina     ->  {punishment}
  - E faʻaleagaina e oe, ma faʻatasi mai i latou -> {temptation}
  - E faʻatasi e oe, ma faʻaleagaina e i latou -> {sucker}
O tagata taʻalo (s) ma le faʻaiʻuga sili atu i le faʻaiʻuga o ripoti uma e fai ma faʻaiʻu.
